{"seq":1,"slug":"timeline-sequencer","title":"时间轴与序列器：过场的数据模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-cutscene-cinematics/authoring/timeline-sequencer","wordCount":1645,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"时间轴与序列器-过场的数据模型\">时间轴与序列器：过场的数据模型</h1><p>一段过场在编辑器里长什么样？它是一条横向的时间轴，上面叠着一摞轨道（track），每条轨道控制一个对象的一种属性随时间变化——这条轨道让角色播一段动画，那条让相机在第 3 秒切换，另一条在第 5 秒触发一声音效。序列器（sequencer）就是组织这一切的工具与背后的数据模型。理解它的数据结构，是理解过场编排的全部技术核心；镜头美学和转场手法都是搭在这个结构之上的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-轨道-关键帧-求值\">核心概念：轨道—关键帧—求值</h2><p>序列器的核心是一个「按时间求值」的系统。它的三个基本构件是轨道（绑定一个对象的一种可动画属性）、关键帧（keyframe，在某个时间点给定属性的一个值）、以及求值器（evaluator，在任意播放时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 上把关键帧插值成当前值）。播放时，系统拿到当前时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，遍历所有轨道，对每条轨道求出该时刻的属性值并写回对象，一帧的过场画面就是这样合成出来的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[播放时间 t] --&gt; B[遍历所有轨道]&#10;  B --&gt; C1[相机轨道&lt;br/&gt;求当前视角]&#10;  B --&gt; C2[动画轨道&lt;br/&gt;求当前姿势]&#10;  B --&gt; C3[变换轨道&lt;br/&gt;求位置/旋转]&#10;  B --&gt; C4[音频轨道&lt;br/&gt;触发/对齐]&#10;  B --&gt; C5[事件轨道&lt;br/&gt;触发回调]&#10;  C1 --&gt; D[写回对象]&#10;  C2 --&gt; D&#10;  C3 --&gt; D&#10;  C4 --&gt; D&#10;  C5 --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E[合成当前帧]\">flowchart TD\n  A[播放时间 t] --&gt; B[遍历所有轨道]\n  B --&gt; C1[相机轨道&lt;br/&gt;求当前视角]\n  B --&gt; C2[动画轨道&lt;br/&gt;求当前姿势]\n  B --&gt; C3[变换轨道&lt;br/&gt;求位置/旋转]\n  B --&gt; C4[音频轨道&lt;br/&gt;触发/对齐]\n  B --&gt; C5[事件轨道&lt;br/&gt;触发回调]\n  C1 --&gt; D[写回对象]\n  C2 --&gt; D\n  C3 --&gt; D\n  C4 --&gt; D\n  C5 --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E[合成当前帧]</pre><p>关键帧之间的取值由插值曲线决定。给定相邻两个关键帧 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(t_0, v_0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(t_1, v_1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，线性插值是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(t) = v_0 + (v_1 - v_0)\\cdot\\frac{t - t_0}{t_1 - t_0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2858em;vertical-align:-0.4451em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8407em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4101em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4451em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>；但过场里更常用带缓入缓出的贝塞尔/三次曲线，让运动有加速减速而非匀速的机械感。曲线的切线控制是编导微调「手感」的主要旋钮，也是相机运动是否显得高级的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"轨道类型-过场要动的东西\">轨道类型：过场要动的东西</h2><p>一条过场时间轴上通常有多种轨道，各司其职。理解有哪些轨道类型，就理解了过场能编排哪些元素。下表列出常见轨道及其职责。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>轨道类型</th>\n<th>控制对象</th>\n<th>典型内容</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>相机切换轨</td>\n<td>相机剪辑</td>\n<td>第 t 秒切到哪个相机</td>\n<td>决定「剪辑」节奏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相机变换轨</td>\n<td>单个相机</td>\n<td>位置/旋转/焦距关键帧</td>\n<td>相机运动的曲线在此</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>骨骼动画轨</td>\n<td>角色</td>\n<td>播放某段动画剪辑</td>\n<td>可叠加、可混合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变换轨</td>\n<td>任意对象</td>\n<td>位置/旋转/缩放</td>\n<td>道具、载具移动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>音频轨</td>\n<td>声音</td>\n<td>配音、音乐、音效</td>\n<td>需与画面帧对齐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件轨</td>\n<td>逻辑</td>\n<td>在某帧触发回调</td>\n<td>触发特效/切换游戏状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可见性/生成轨</td>\n<td>对象</td>\n<td>出现/隐藏/spawn</td>\n<td>控制演员进出场</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子序列轨</td>\n<td>嵌套序列</td>\n<td>引用另一段序列</td>\n<td>复用与分层组织</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中事件轨是过场与游戏逻辑的接口：它能在精确的帧触发回调，用来播放粒子特效、切换灯光状态、或通知游戏系统「过场进行到这里了」——这是<a href=\"../integration/gameplay-to-cutscene\">游玩与过场衔接</a>在运行时挂钩过场的主要机制。子序列轨则是组织复杂过场的关键，让长过场能拆成可复用、可分工的小段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两大主流实现-sequencer-与-timeline\">两大主流实现：Sequencer 与 Timeline</h2><p>工业界两套主流工具体现了同一套数据模型的不同取舍。虚幻引擎的 Sequencer 是一套非线性编辑套件，被官方定位为「创作影视化内容的主要工具」，能操控相机做穿场、动画灯光、驱动角色、并直接渲染输出（据 Epic 官方文档，dev.epicgames.com）。UE 5.6 起还引入了 Cinematic Assembly Toolset（可复用的镜头模板与更紧的管线集成）、Quick Render（一键从选定相机渲染）与 in-editor 的 Mocap Manager。Unity 的 Timeline 则以轨道 + 可扩展的自定义 PlayableTrack 著称，通过 Playable 图把动画、音频、激活、信号（Signal，相当于事件）组织起来，并常与 Cinemachine 配合做相机。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>Unreal Sequencer</th>\n<th>Unity Timeline</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>相机方案</td>\n<td>内建 Cine Camera + 切换轨</td>\n<td>配合 Cinemachine</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件机制</td>\n<td>Event Track + 绑定</td>\n<td>Signal / Marker</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复用组织</td>\n<td>Subsequence / 模板</td>\n<td>嵌套 Timeline / Control Track</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩展性</td>\n<td>自定义 Track/Section</td>\n<td>自定义 PlayableTrack</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渲染输出</td>\n<td>Movie Render Queue / Quick Render</td>\n<td>Recorder 包</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>无论哪套工具，落到程序视角都是同一件事：一个可序列化的时间轴资产 + 一个运行时求值器。搞清这一点，工具间的迁移就只是术语翻译。</p>\n<h2 id=\"编排的工程实践\">编排的工程实践</h2><p>把序列器用好，有几条跨工具的通用实践。其一是分层与复用：用子序列把「一段对话」「一个反应镜头」封装成可独立编辑、可在多处引用的单元，避免一条几千帧的巨型时间轴无法维护。其二是数据与表演分离：把可本地化的内容（字幕、配音）放在独立轨道并由数据驱动，而非烧进主序列，这直接服务<a href=\"../practice/localization-subtitles\">本地化与字幕</a>的多语言需求。其三是事件轨只发信号不写逻辑：事件轨触发的回调应尽量薄，把实际逻辑留在游戏系统里，保持过场资产的可移植。</p>\n<p>对话密集型过场还有一个专门的编排范式：由对话系统驱动序列器。角色说哪句话、配哪段音、对应哪个反应镜头，由对话数据决定并在运行时组装成演出，这是<a href=\"../../game-dialogue-systems/content/cinematic-orchestration\">对话系统</a>与过场的交汇点。理解序列器是「可被数据驱动的编排引擎」，而不仅是「美术手摆关键帧的工具」，才能做出可规模化的过场管线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>序列器的核心是轨道—关键帧—求值：每条轨道绑定一个对象的一种属性，求值器在任意时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 把关键帧插值成当前值并写回。</li>\n<li>关键帧间用带缓入缓出的曲线插值，曲线切线是编导调「手感」的主要旋钮。</li>\n<li>轨道类型决定能编排什么：相机、动画、变换、音频、事件、可见性、子序列各司其职；事件轨是与游戏逻辑的接口。</li>\n<li>Unreal Sequencer 与 Unity Timeline 是同一数据模型的两种实现，2026 年 Sequencer 引入了 Cinematic Assembly、Quick Render 等提效工具。</li>\n<li>工程实践三条：分层复用、数据与表演分离、事件轨只发信号；对话密集过场宜由数据驱动编排。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"blending-transitions\">混合与转场</a>——轨道之上，镜头与动画之间怎样平滑过渡。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../integration/gameplay-to-cutscene\">游玩与过场衔接</a>——事件轨如何在运行时挂钩游戏状态。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../game-dialogue-systems/content/cinematic-orchestration\">对话的影视化编排</a>——对话数据如何驱动序列器生成演出。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"时间轴与序列器：过场的数据模型","id":"时间轴与序列器-过场的数据模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：轨道—关键帧—求值","id":"核心概念-轨道-关键帧-求值"},{"level":2,"text":"轨道类型：过场要动的东西","id":"轨道类型-过场要动的东西"},{"level":2,"text":"两大主流实现：Sequencer 与 Timeline","id":"两大主流实现-sequencer-与-timeline"},{"level":2,"text":"编排的工程实践","id":"编排的工程实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"类型谱系：从全动态视频到可行走的演出","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-cutscene-cinematics/foundations/cutscene-types"},"next":{"title":"镜头语言：用相机把信息变成情绪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-cutscene-cinematics/authoring/camera-cinematography"}}